			"date": "2022-11-21T17:21:30.459Z",
			"content": "<p>You can see this in action on the Eleventy Twitter Archive, where any links to <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">twitter.com/zachleat/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> now link to <a href=\"https://zachleat.com/twitter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">zachleat.com/twitter/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> instead.</p><p>e.g. <a href=\"https://twitter.11ty.dev/1238956883488235520/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">twitter.11ty.dev/1238956883488</span><span class=\"invisible\">235520/</span></a></p>",
